20
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:34,240
Light machine gun plus 10,000 rounds of ammunition

21
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:35,240
Plus body armor helmet

22
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,440
One hundred tons of sanitary napkins

23
00:00:36,440 --> 00:00:38,080
System space fifty cubic meters

24
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:39,040
gunshot

25
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:40,840
